msgid "Credential:"
msgstr "Dintiúr:"

msgid ""
"No saved credentials yet. Tick \"Save password\" when you are asked for the "
"password, or create one in Tools > Credentials Manager."
msgstr "Níl aon dintiúr sábháilte fós. Cuir tic le \"Sábháil an focal faire\" nuair a iarrtar an focal faire ort, nó cruthaigh ceann in Uirlisí > Bainisteoir Dintiúr."

msgid ""
"OpenCRT answers the host's first login and password prompts with this "
"credential, unless you start typing first. Manage credentials in Tools > "
"Credentials Manager."
msgstr "Freagraíonn OpenCRT an chéad leid logála isteach agus focail faire ón óstríomhaire leis an dintiúr seo, mura dtosaíonn tú ag clóscríobh ar dtús. Bainistigh dintiúir in Uirlisí > Bainisteoir Dintiúr."

msgid ""
"The username (if the credential has one) and the saved password come from "
"this credential. Manage credentials in Tools > Credentials Manager."
msgstr "Tagann an t-ainm úsáideora (má tá ceann ag an dintiúr) agus an focal faire sábháilte ón dintiúr seo. Bainistigh dintiúir in Uirlisí > Bainisteoir Dintiúr."

msgid "Private key file:"
msgstr "Comhad eochrach príobháidí:"

msgid "blank to use password authentication"
msgstr "bán chun fíordheimhniú focail faire a úsáid"

msgid "Certificate:"
msgstr "Teastas:"

msgid "optional; <key file>-cert.pub is used if it exists"
msgstr "roghnach; úsáidtear <key file>-cert.pub má tá sé ann"

msgid ""
"Allow legacy algorithms (SHA-1 key exchange, CBC ciphers) for old devices"
msgstr "Ceadaigh algartaim oidhreachta (malartú eochrach SHA-1, sifir CBC) do sheanghléasanna"

msgid "Enable compression (for slow links)"
msgstr "Cumasaigh comhbhrú (do naisc mhalla)"

msgid "Forward the SSH agent (only to hosts you trust)"
msgstr "Atreoraigh an gníomhaire SSH (chuig óstríomhairí iontaofa amháin)"

msgid ""
"Order tried: public key (the key file if set, otherwise keys in a running "
"SSH agent such as Pageant), then keyboard-interactive or password. Passwords "
"are only saved in a credential, in the system keychain; otherwise you are "
"asked for them when needed."
msgstr "Ord na n-iarrachtaí: eochair phoiblí (an comhad eochrach má tá sé socraithe, nó eochracha i ngníomhaire SSH atá ag rith, mar Pageant), ansin keyboard-interactive nó focal faire. Ní shábháiltear focail faire ach i ndintiúr, i bhfáinne eochracha an chórais; murach sin iarrtar ort iad nuair a bhíonn gá leo."

