msgstr "Focal faire do {}@{}:"

msgid "The saved password was not accepted ({}); enter it again."
msgstr "Níor glacadh leis an bhfocal faire sábháilte ({}); cuir isteach arís é."

msgid "{} is not a fixed-width font."
msgstr "Ní cló aonleithid é {}."

msgid "The file is empty."
msgstr "Tá an comhad folamh."

msgid "The first line must name the columns, including a host (or hostname) column."
msgstr "Caithfidh an chéad líne na colúin a ainmniú, colún host (nó hostname) san áireamh."

