msgstr "Líne {}: prótacal anaithnid \"{}\"."

msgid "Enter a folder name (without \"/\")."
msgstr "Cuir isteach ainm fillteáin (gan \"/\")."

msgid "No SecureCRT sessions in {}. Pick the Config folder that contains the Sessions folder."
msgstr "Níl aon seisiún SecureCRT in {}. Roghnaigh an fillteán Config ina bhfuil an fillteán Sessions."

msgid "Credential \"{}\": {}; asking for the password instead."
msgstr "Dintiúr \"{}\": {}; iarrtar an focal faire ina ionad."

msgid "Update Now installs it and restarts OpenCRT."
msgstr "Suiteálann Nuashonraigh Anois é agus atosaíonn sé OpenCRT."

msgid "Update it with your system's package manager."
msgstr "Nuashonraigh é le bainisteoir pacáistí do chórais."

msgid "To get it, and later versions, with your system's updates, set up the OpenCRT package repository once: kimp0ssible-no.github.io/OpenCRT"
msgstr "Chun é a fháil, agus leaganacha níos déanaí, le nuashonruithe do chórais, socraigh stórlann pacáistí OpenCRT uair amháin: kimp0ssible-no.github.io/OpenCRT"

msgid "Download the portable zip from the release page and replace the program files in this folder; the settings folder stays as it is."
msgstr "Íoslódáil an zip iniompartha ón leathanach eisiúna agus cuir é in ionad chomhaid an ríomhchláir san fhillteán seo; fanann an fillteán socruithe mar atá."

msgid "Download it from the release page."
msgstr "Íoslódáil é ón leathanach eisiúna."

